<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>DramaBox VF</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #10121b;
      color: white;
    }
    header {
      background: #171b2b;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    header h1 {
      color: #00e5ff;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .search {
      width: 85%;
      padding: 12px;
      margin-top: 15px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: none;
    }
    main {
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .empty {
      background: #1b2030;
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>🎬 DramaBox VF</h1>
    <p>Les meilleurs dramas chinois en français</p>
    <input class="search" type="search"
      placeholder="Rechercher un drama...">
  </header>
  <main>
    <h2>Nos dramas</h2>
    <div class="empty">
      <p>Aucun drama pour le moment.</p>
      <p>Les nouveaux dramas apparaîtront ici.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
